{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國獨立工人工會（IWGB）自2026年初以來一直在Rockstar North推動成立Rockstar員工工會，希望就薪資與獎金、加班、裁員、彈性工作安排以及生成式人工智能政策等問題展開談判。然而，在經歷一系列會議後，這一擬議中的IWGB Rockstar遊戲工人工會於11月26日舉行了工會認證投票。IWGB本人確認，此次投票未能通過。據報道，25%的員工投票支持工會獲得認證，75%的員工投下反對票。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1588178.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T07:04:04.678822+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T06:50:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T06:57:12.891815+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T06:57:12.891815+00:00","content_hash":"9a0cc3fbdded5f1259c9d3ac4b186597442cb4d0b547f3715b5a9d622f778519","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}